    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "⟨a⟩",
      "rationale": "נפשך nɔnabila 'i' b'a to a yɛrɛ la kɔrɔda; an ye nɔnabila dɔ fara a kan walasa a ka klarɛ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "נפשך",
      "rationale": "נפש ye 'ni' ye — jɔyɔrɔ min bɛ balo — a tɛ 'dusi' ye cogo kelen na; 'i ni' ka ɲɛ waani."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "to kalanbaga",
      "rationale": "Kumasen in bɛ kalanbaga kelen de ɲɛ fɔ 'ni i b'a fɔ' fɛ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "תכן",
      "rationale": "Ala bɛ dusukunw jate (kɔlɔsi ni ja ye) — a ye kunko ye min b'a jira ko a bɛ mɔgɔw ka baara ka jate."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Ni i b'a fɔ ko: Tao, an ma o dɔn — dusukunw min bɛ jate, wale aa b'a faamu wa? ni min bɛ ⟨a⟩ mara, wale a b'o dɔn wa? a bɛna a furakɛ mɔgɔ la, a baara cogo min na.",
